sequenceDiagram
    participant Event as "Business Event: Control"
    participant Service as "notificationService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    participant Hub as "Azure Notification Hubs: External System"
    Event->>Service: publish(order/status/inventory/payment event)
    Service->>+DB: Resolve recipients by role and assignment scope
    Service->>+DB: Persist notification and outbox message
    DB-->>-Service: Notification queued
    Service->>+Hub: Send push notification
    alt Delivery accepted
        Hub-->>-Service: Provider success
        Service->>DB: Mark delivery attempt successful
    else Provider unavailable
        Hub-->>Service: Provider error
        Service->>DB: Keep retryable outcome and source transaction unchanged
    end

